k\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:CONS_Drug_Ether+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<ul><li>Consume to inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ether-Essence_Slumber_(Condition)\" title=\"Ether-Essence Slumber (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ether-Essence Slumber\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ether-Essence_Slumber_(Condition)\" title=\"Ether-Essence Slumber (Condition)\">Ether-Essence Slumber</a> on yourself</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Ether-Essence_Slumber\"> Condition: Ether-Essence Slumber </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ether-Essence_Slumber_(Condition)\" title=\"Ether-Essence Slumber (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ether-Essence Slumber\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/DRUG_Essence_of_Ether_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ether-Essence_Slumber_(Condition)\" title=\"Ether-Essence Slumber (Condition)\">Ether-Essence Slumber</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>A deep, dream-ridden sleep has overcome the creature, induced by judicious ingesting of Ether.</li>\n<li>The creature cannot move or act.</li>\n<li>The creature automatically fails <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> against the creature have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a></li>\n<li>Removed by taking damage or being <a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\">Shoved</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Severn\" title=\"Severn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Portrait_Severn.png/25px-Portrait_Severn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Portrait_Severn.png/38px-Portrait_Severn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Portrait_Severn.png/50px-Portrait_Severn.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Severn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Portrait_Severn.png/25px-Portrait_Severn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Portrait_Severn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Severn\" title=\"Severn\">Severn</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Guildhall\" title=\"Guildhall\">Guildhall</a></li>\n<li>In the wooden crate near <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Huido\" title=\"Huido\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Huido.png/25px-Portrait_Huido.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Huido.png/38px-Portrait_Huido.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Huido.png/50px-Portrait_Huido.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Huido\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Huido.png/25px-Portrait_Huido.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href